invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_mont.c
catches: rsa_ifma_model_test
reason: rsa_vp1_cpu hands rsa_ifma_public an even modulus, which has no
  inverse of its low digit, so the kernel writes other bytes than
  rsa_vp1, whose answer rsa.h promises for every input under the bit, an
  even n included. bin/rsa_ifma_model_test compares rsa_vp1_cpu under
  the bit with rsa_vp1 for an even modulus that the dispatch must refuse.

--- old
        (n[n_len - 1] & 1) == 1) {
--- new
        1) {
